  "material_semantics_and_gaps": [
    "Ch15_nonPBR is diffuse/specular/glossiness material data, not a complete original metallic-roughness PBR set. No character metallic, roughness or AO map was found among the source character image datablocks or map files.",
    "Both source material graphs wire Diffuse to Base Color, Normal via Normal Map, Specular to Specular IOR Level; 1002 also wires Emissive to Emission Color. Both Glossiness texture nodes are present but unlinked; both source materials use scalar roughness 0.78 and metallic 0.0.",
    "The old GLB embeds seven used images and uses KHR_materials_specular; renderer support and specular interpretation still require runtime verification. Its missing glossiness is explained by unlinked source nodes, not lost source bytes.",
    "Native maps cover the original body only. Additional reconstructed spare sleeve/carrier and weapon geometry are outside this body UV-identity proof. Weapon maps7 inputs are not character maps.",
    "Current shared-ready source contains no texture images. Reusing source maps would require an explicitly separate material-restoration/export step; no such step was performed.",
    "No render, PBR reconstruction, bake, novel textures, export or publication performed; no claim of exact final runtime appearance."
  ],
